        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia Mortise Lock Body Only</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMortise lock box for Omnia levers.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Dormitory Function:</b> Dormitory or Exit Lock function is defined as a lock where the latch bolt is operated by the lever from either side, except when the outside lever is made inoperative by a stop or mechanical means other than a key. The dead bolt is projected by the key from the outside and by turn from inside. The dead bolt is retracted by key from the outside and by the turn from the inside. Operating the inside lever retracts both bolts and the outside lever remains locked.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b>for the Omnia Mortise Lock Box:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Function: Dormitory Function</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Handing: Left Hand</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSpecial Ordered Item. <b>Not Returnable</b>\r\n</p>",
